<title>USA: New York physical copper market - Mar 18.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - Mar 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for March shipment were quoted at a nominal 115.25 to 115.50 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 91.00 cents, up one cent from March 17th.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
